> VAX network. This data is read via pathworks on local pcs.
> 
> We would like to get rid of the VAX completely and read this data off
> the optical drives connected directly to the NT network.
> 
> Is there any conversion software out their that will run on an NT and
> take file 11 vax formated data and convert it to NT file format ???
