* Can I have DECnet IV back? If not what would be the benefit of using phase
V

UCX dns lookup:
* Solutions?

Threads:
* I guess I will have to change all my programs :-(((((
* Is there any symbol which version of the pthread library I'm compiling
with?
  My programms must run with the old and new version!

Thanks in advance.


-Jens-Uwe Schluetter.







